<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1442703623"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:34.040" ttm:agent="v3"><div begin="13.660" end="39.143" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="13.660" end="19.587" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.660" end="14.443">与你</span><span begin="14.443" end="15.276">约错</span><span begin="15.276" end="15.662">终</span><span begin="15.662" end="16.469">点</span> <span begin="16.469" end="17.280">命运</span><span begin="17.280" end="17.813">都</span><span begin="17.813" end="18.582">改</span><span begin="18.582" end="19.587">编</span></p><p begin="19.808" end="25.822" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.808" end="20.224">我</span><span begin="20.224" end="21.056">爱你</span><span begin="21.056" end="21.840">快了</span><span begin="21.840" end="22.206">一</span><span begin="22.206" end="22.992">点</span> <span begin="22.992" end="23.457">你</span><span begin="23.457" end="25.111">发现慢了</span><span begin="25.111" end="25.822">点</span></p><p begin="25.942" end="32.128" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.942" end="26.855">某天</span><span begin="26.855" end="28.426">我吻过你</span><span begin="28.426" end="28.774">腮</span><span begin="28.774" end="29.476">边</span> <span begin="29.476" end="31.145">连情节也</span><span begin="31.145" end="31.529">扰</span><span begin="31.529" end="32.128">乱</span></p><p begin="32.328" end="39.143" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.328" end="33.156">最好</span><span begin="33.156" end="34.740">全部记忆</span><span begin="34.740" end="35.126">收</span><span begin="35.126" end="35.893">起</span> <span begin="35.893" end="36.395">终会</span><span begin="36.395" end="37.544">淡忘你</span><span begin="37.544" end="37.913">的</span><span begin="37.913" end="39.143">脸</span></p></div><div begin="39.487" end="1:09.457" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="39.487" end="44.927" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="39.487" end="40.323">如果</span><span begin="40.323" end="41.092">盛世</span><sp